Krita Nova 18 - app name "Nova Krita"

The name people see is now "Nova Krita"; internal identifiers stay the same,
so existing settings, resources and file associations keep working.

1. KAboutData display name (krita/main.cc): "Nova Krita". Qt uses it as the
   application display name (window titles, About dialog, crash dialogs).
2. Message box / dialog titles: every i18n("Krita") and
   i18nc("@title:window", "Krita") becomes "Nova Krita" (103 places).
3. Android launcher name: AndroidManifest.xml "Nova Krita"; the debug flavor
   (the CI APKs) "Nova Krita" instead of "Krita Debug"; the next flavor
   "Nova Krita Next".

Unchanged on purpose: the application/config name "krita" (kritarc, resource
folder), the Android package id org.krita(.debug), and Krita's own links and
donation texts.

